{"title":"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f130b65813b7c1ea07539ddf68a6b4dd390cd7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AIME$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> has sides of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> units.  Isosceles triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a6a2bf9bbbe09fa940fcf3429bfd8326db1315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GEM$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> has base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4afc0b14ca58c4f35514e7cfa7adb0bd55226f2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EM$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />, and the area common to triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a6a2bf9bbbe09fa940fcf3429bfd8326db1315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GEM$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> and square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f130b65813b7c1ea07539ddf68a6b4dd390cd7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AIME$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> square units.  Find the length of the altitude to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4afc0b14ca58c4f35514e7cfa7adb0bd55226f2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EM$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/f/aff7da279a0d3b906ac2392ebe4826868845c6be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle GEM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that if the altitude of the triangle is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then the maximum area of the intersection of the triangle and the square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b19ab5df4865b675f6d647cbdf2226d7757f26b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot10=50$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />.\nThis implies that vertex G must be located outside of square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f130b65813b7c1ea07539ddf68a6b4dd390cd7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AIME$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/621cda5459b0a04c3bb47fbec28d266740d0a08b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair E=(0,0), M=(10,0), I=(10,10), A=(0,10); draw(A--I--M--E--cycle); pair G=(5,25); draw(G--E--M--cycle); label(&quot;\\(G\\)&quot;,G,N); label(&quot;\\(A\\)&quot;,A,NW); label(&quot;\\(I\\)&quot;,I,NE); label(&quot;\\(M\\)&quot;,M,NE); label(&quot;\\(E\\)&quot;,E,NW); label(&quot;\\(10\\)&quot;,(M+E)/2,S); [/asy]\" width=\"135\" height=\"252\" /></center>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/9/e195ed4818e368e25b7cb6e335e24d0613ba50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GE$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcb6f9286d36a1d244aa1be5a7fb0e274d53ee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AI$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e46a5d559ffff94b22f2df24968accfa7438cbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GM$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcb6f9286d36a1d244aa1be5a7fb0e274d53ee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AI$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/6/f860bad02d9948e082091618875c87a8cd19663a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY=6$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> since the area of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trapezoid\" title=\"Trapezoid\">trapezoid</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/904f6496bd38b27655aa3461a19a35f186522a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XYME$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/07319cbacd3adee9cad9d81ab5cfdf429ea2cb45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle GXY \\sim \\triangle GEM$\" width=\"149\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Let the height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/b/40b7a6cab5a109c2c91916218ae2507e04551291.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GXY$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. By the similarity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73b6ee16a0287356b00774f07bfe86bff9026ef5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{h}{6} = \\dfrac{h + 10}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9b3c6510f4e0727b80ada10277f881d58ab27ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, the height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a6a2bf9bbbe09fa940fcf3429bfd8326db1315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GEM$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/f/e6ff4e5a9d04e4a91a0b07cae653afd7f6c7d335.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h + 10 = \\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I\" title=\"2008 AIME I\">2008 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>this could have been a #1-#5 on the amc 10 lol\n</p></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190103\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 221/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1786/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5025/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.816      1 -total\n 60.62%    7.769      1 Template:AIME_box\n 37.69%    4.830      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6616:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190103 and revision id 140961. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}